\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces What FreeReg does at a glance. Given an arbitrary 3D model (CT airway or CAD mesh) and an arbitrary image/video stream (RGB-D or monocular), FreeReg estimates the free-coordinate projection map $\mathbf  {x}_{p}=\pi _{D}(K\,\mathbf  {T}_{cm}(\mathbf  {X}_{m}+W(\mathbf  {X}_{m})))$ into the camera and pixel frames---no privileged world frame, each factor (intrinsics, depth, pose, deformation) estimated or clamped---and composites an anchored, occlusion-aware AR/MR overlay whose photometric residual feeds back as an online validation signal.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:concept}{{1}{2}{What FreeReg does at a glance. Given an arbitrary 3D model (CT airway or CAD mesh) and an arbitrary image/video stream (RGB-D or monocular), FreeReg estimates the free-coordinate projection map $\mathbf {x}_{p}=\pi _{D}(K\,\mathbf {T}_{cm}(\mathbf {X}_{m}+W(\mathbf {X}_{m})))$ into the camera and pixel frames---no privileged world frame, each factor (intrinsics, depth, pose, deformation) estimated or clamped---and composites an anchored, occlusion-aware AR/MR overlay whose photometric residual feeds back as an online validation signal}{figure.1}{}}
