\newlabel{fig:ct_overlay}{{4}{8}{Registered airway model on the CT cross-sections (axial / coronal / sagittal). The registered 3D airway model (orange points) and its centerline (red) are overlaid on the three orthogonal CT slices, with the airway lumen shown in blue (light fill, dark outline), confirming model-to-CT agreement in the image volume}{figure.4}{}}
